ring the month, the average of the experts’ year-end price predictions was over 12% higher.","title":"LBMA snapshot survey predicts gold price average near $4,500/oz by year-end","teaserHeadline":null,"urlAlias":"/news/article/2026-08-12/lbma-snapshot-survey-predicts-gold-price-average-near-4500oz-year-end","source":{"name":"Kitco News","subtitle":"The Leading News Source in Precious Metals","description":"\u003cp\u003eKitco NEWS has a diverse team of journalists reporting on the economy, stock markets, commodities, cryptocurrencies, mining and metals with accuracy and objectivity. Our goal is to help people make informed market decisions through in-depth reporting, daily market roundups, interviews with prominent industry figures, comprehensive coverage (often exclusive) of important industry events and analyses of market-affecting developments.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"},"audioTts":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-12T13:26:20-0400","updatedAt":"2026-08-12T13:37:31-0400","image":{"detail":{"default":{"srcset":"https://image-api.prod.kitco.com/image/7cb8e990-96a6-4e2d-ada6-d1a174b6ffaa.png?top=0.15981657608696\u0026left=0\u0026width=1672\u0026height=940.68036684783\u0026scale_width=1920\u0026token=a1801e50f0548a8d9dd142411c2079a21241a9aa3b80e0f25c6f84571b5e2328"},"sources":{"teaser_small":{"srcset":"https://image-api.prod.kitco.com/image/7cb8e990-96a6-4e2d-ada6-d1a174b6ffaa.png?top=0.15981657608696\u0026left=0\u0026width=1672\u0026height=940.68036684783\u0026scale_width=200\u0026token=d478afe00d7dbde7c9ac7f46466efcad78481c780b186e2aa843f46e708db96a","media":"all and (min-width: 0px)"},"teaser_medium":{"srcset":"https://image-api.prod.kitco.com/image/7cb8e990-96a6-4e2d-ada6-d1a174b6ffaa.png?top=0.15981657608696\u0026left=0\u0026width=1672\u0026height=940.68036684783\u0026scale_width=400\u0026token=19d7e8cf4956fcd35d51d45fedb0e27b42608e2932d91f52f8f1111b953d52d8","media":"all and (min-width: 0px)"},"desktop":{"media":"all and (min-width: 1024px)","srcset":"https://image-api.prod.ki